# FINAL FANTASY IX (Japan): the kanji of each place's own font. A place is known by a hash of its font's glyph
# list and its messages' records (the script's place_key); a line is a code's number in that font, in hex (0xFC 03 is 03), and its kanji.
# Only what was read off the screen in that place.
